# quest/019/HeaVnz801_01931 — «Stop Bugging Me» · in play order
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: ru\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: セノタフ大石碑のウールニクスは、冒険者を値踏みしている。
#. de: Wollnix will dich auf den Prüfstand stellen.
#. fr: Woolnix souhaite vous jauger.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/019/HeaVnz801_01931:TEXT_HEAVNZ801_01931_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "Woolnix is eyeing you with obvious interest."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ウールニクスは、<sheet BNpcName 3593 0>の被害に苦しんでいるらしい。低地ドラヴァニアのシャーレアン選者街にいる「<sheet BNpcName 3593 0>」を3体討伐しよう。
#. de: Wollnix leidet unter den aggressiven <noun-de BNpcName 5 3593 2 3 1> aus dem Manufaktur-Viertel. Vielleicht kannst du ihm zumindest drei Exemplare vom Hals schaffen.
#. fr: Woolnix vous demande d'éliminer les <noun-fr BNpcName 12 3593 2 1> qui le harcèlent. Cherchez au quartier des Collectionneurs et éliminez trois de ces nuisibles.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/019/HeaVnz801_01931:TEXT_HEAVNZ801_01931_SEQ_01:1"
msgid "Woolnix is fretting about the great swarm of tarantula hawks in the Collectors' Quarter. He does not feel safe guarding the gate whilst they are so near. Thus, he bids you slay three, in hopes that they will no more encroach upon his position."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet BNpcName 3593 0>を討伐した。セノタフ大石碑の「ウールニクス」に報告しよう。
#. de: Du hast drei <noun-de BNpcName 5 3593 2 4 1> besiegt. Berichte Wollnix am Zenotaph davon.
#. fr: Vous avez vaillamment terrassé les <noun-fr BNpcName 12 3593 2 1> perturbatrices. Retournez voir Woolnix pour empocher votre récompense.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/019/HeaVnz801_01931:TEXT_HEAVNZ801_01931_SEQ_02:1"
msgid "You have struck down three tarantula hawks. Deliver tidings of your victory to Woolnix near the Cenotaph."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet BNpcName 3593 0>を駆除したことをウールニクスに伝えた。これで、彼も安心して門番の仕事に専念できるだろう。
#. de: Wollnix ist hocherfreut. Endlich kann er seinen Dienst ohne Angst versehen.
#. fr: Grâce à vous, Woolnix pourra continuer son travail de sentinelle en se contentant de chasser seulement les intrus, et plus les guêpes.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/019/HeaVnz801_01931:TEXT_HEAVNZ801_01931_SEQ_03:1"
msgid "Woolnix reveals to you that he was stung by a tarantula hawk, and, driven mad by the pain, left his post. Now that there are a few less hovering about nearby, however, he believes he can do his duty in safety."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet BNpcName 3593 0>を討伐
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de BNpcName 5 3593 2 4 1></capitalize> im Manufaktur-Viertel beseitigen
#. fr: Vaincre des <noun-fr BNpcName 12 3593 2 1>
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/019/HeaVnz801_01931:TEXT_HEAVNZ801_01931_TODO_00:1"
msgid "Slay tarantula hawks."
msgstr ""

#. ja: セノタフ大石碑のウールニクスに報告
#. de: Wollnix am Zenotaph Bericht erstatten
#. fr: Retourner voir Woolnix
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/019/HeaVnz801_01931:TEXT_HEAVNZ801_01931_TODO_01:1"
msgid "Report to Woolnix."
msgstr ""

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>お前さん　なかなか　強そう　やり手そう～。
#. de: Psh ... Großwachsene<if $gn4><else>r</if> haben geschickte Kämpfenhand?
#. fr: Psssh... L'aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if> a l'air fort<if $gn4>e</if><nbsp>!
#. speaker: WOOLKNIX
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/019/HeaVnz801_01931:TEXT_HEAVNZ801_01931_WOOLKNIX_000_000:1"
msgid "Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Uplander has good arm for fighty-tool, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet BNpcName 3593 0>」　3匹退治　頼みたい～。<br>数が増え　門まで来るから　困ってる～。<br>「選者街」で　数を減らして　ちょ～だいよ～。
#. de: Wollnix kann nicht Gedanken zusammenbinden. Kommen Flattertier mit laute Flattern in Ohr ganzetag! Kannzu vielleicht aus Manufaktur-Viertel scheuchen? Dreistück <noun-de BNpcName 5 3593 2 1 1>? Kho?
#. fr: Woolnix aimerait que quelqu'un abatte trois <noun-fr BNpcName 12 3593 2 1> pour lui, au quartier des Collectionneurs<nbsp>! Allez, quoi<nbsp>!
#. speaker: WOOLKNIX
msgctxt "quest/019/HeaVnz801_01931:TEXT_HEAVNZ801_01931_WOOLKNIX_000_001:1"
msgid "Please, kill tarantula hawks for Woolnix. They are swarming in Collectors' Quarter, giving Woolnix terrible fright when gate guarding. Kill three, and Woolnix is feeling safer!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet BNpcName 3593 0>」　3匹　退治　頼みたい～。<br>数が増え　門まで来るから　困ってる～。<br>「選者街」で　数を減らして　ちょ～だいよ～。
#. de: Kannzu drei <noun-de BNpcName 5 3593 2 1 1> aus Manufaktur-Viertel scheuchen? Wollnix wird haben große Dankenfühl in Herz für immerzeit.
#. fr: Woolnix aimerait que quelqu'un abatte trois <noun-fr BNpcName 12 3593 2 1> pour lui, au quartier des Collectionneurs<nbsp>! Allez, quoi<nbsp>!
#. speaker: WOOLKNIX
msgctxt "quest/019/HeaVnz801_01931:TEXT_HEAVNZ801_01931_WOOLKNIX_000_010:1"
msgid "With so many tarantula hawks in Collectors' Quarter, Woolnix worried about gate guarding in safety."
msgstr ""

#. ja: シュコォ……シュコォ……<br>さすが　やり手の冒険者　ありがたいね　助かった～。
#. de: Khoo! Hazzu Flattertier besiegt? Wollnix wird halten Großwachsene<if $gn4><else>r</if> in Herz bis Sterbentag!
#. fr: Psssh, pssh... Beau travail, beau travail<nbsp>! Woolnix est re<shy>con<shy>nais<shy>sant<nbsp>!
#. speaker: WOOLKNIX
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/019/HeaVnz801_01931:TEXT_HEAVNZ801_01931_WOOLKNIX_000_020:1"
msgid "Pshhh... Shkohhh...<br>Uplander does great favor for Woolnix! In truth, Woolnix ran away when attacked by bugs. Woolnix was scolded for leaving gate unwatched, but this is unfair!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 虫に刺されて　逃げ惑い　門番放置で　怒られた～。<br>虫さえ減って　来なくなりゃ　安心しきって　見張れるぞ～。<br>助け合いは　すばらしい　これからどうぞ　よろしく頼む～！
#. de: Jetzt kann Wollnix endlich Arbeit machen.<br>Kho? Was Arbeit ist?<br>Wollnix muss aufpassen mit Wacheauge und Flattertier scheuchen! Was hazzu denn glauben?
#. fr: Woolnix se fait tout le temps piquer par ces sales insectes<nbsp>! Woolnix s'est enfui... et Woolnix a abandonné sa garde et du coup s'est fait gronder<nbsp>! Moins il y aura d'insectes, moins Woolnix aura de problèmes<nbsp>! Même les gardes ont le droit d'avoir peur des petites bêtes<nbsp>!
#. speaker: WOOLKNIX
msgctxt "quest/019/HeaVnz801_01931:TEXT_HEAVNZ801_01931_WOOLKNIX_000_021:1"
msgid "Woolnix was stung by tarantula hawk, ran because pain was driving Woolnix mad! \\<sigh> But now tarantula hawks are fewer, Woolnix can patrol in peace."
msgstr ""
